<h3 dir="auto" class="text-xl">Relevance to the Essay</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Your habit of using the "like" button as a personal bookmark highlights how individuals navigate the attention economyâ€™s infrastructure. In the context of Hansonâ€™s predicament:</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
