<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">While this observation is peripheral, it can be woven into the essayâ€™s discussion of the attention economyâ€™s structural forces (Section 3 or 7) to illustrate how user behaviors are shaped by, and sometimes subvert, platform design.</p>
