</span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 1.5em; transform: translateY(604.8px);"><span><span>Hanson seeks actionable levers, but the interviewer chases viral headlines. This role reversal defines the Clickbait Empire: serious reform is recast as abstract, while unregulatable speculation is packaged as concrete </span><span style="color: rgb(198, 120, 221);">\citep</span><span>{fridman2021,bbc2021}.
