</span></span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 1.5em; transform: translateY(669.6px);"><span>
</span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 1.5em; transform: translateY(691.2px);"><span>The media ecosystem---podcasts, YouTube, and online platforms---favors spectacle over substance. A 2024 podcast exchange illustrates this:
