<h3 dir="auto" class="text-xl">Updated Op-Ed</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The op-ed is updated to ensure consistent capitalization of Hansonâ€™s name, using the corrected podcast title and <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">plainnat</span> style consistency. It retains the title <em>Clickbait Empire: Robin Hansonâ€™s Struggle Against the Tyranny of Attention</em>, ~300 words, and inline hyperlinks.</p>
